'Open packet':'当前审核包','No open packet. Generate one to see what the pipeline proposes for everything currently waiting.':'没有打开的审核包。生成一个，看看流水线对当前所有待处理内容的提议。','Generate packet (simulated pipeline)':'生成审核包（模拟流水线）','Import packet (.json)':'导入审核包（.json）','Export decisions (.json)':'导出决定（.json）','Accept':'接受','Reject':'拒绝','Edit in workbench':'去工作台修改','accepted':'已接受','rejected':'已拒绝','pending':'待定','items':'项','Everything the pipeline proposes lands here. Accept applies it; reject drops it; edit opens the step so you can change it before accepting. In production this file is written by Claude and your decisions are written back.':'流水线的所有提议都到这里。接受即应用；拒绝即丢弃；修改会打开对应步骤，改完再接受。正式版里这个文件由 Claude 写出，你的决定再写回去。','Proposal':'提议','confidence':'置信度','Past packets':'历史审核包','Agreement by step':'各步一致率','No decisions yet.':'尚无决定。',
